{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"权模"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“权模”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>固定 Lie 代数的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Cartan子代数","text":"Cartan 子代数"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathfrak h\\subset \\mathfrak g$.</p>\n<p>设 $M$ 是 $\\mathfrak g$ 的表示. 对于 $\\lambda\\in \\mathfrak h^*$, 定义权空间 (weight space, 参见"},{"Local":{"url":"权","text":"权"}},{"Plain":")\n$$\r\nM_\\lambda = \\{m\\in M: hm=\\lambda(h)m\\forall h\\in\\mathfrak h\\}.\r\n$$\n若 $M$ 等于所有 $M_\\lambda$ 的直和, 则称其为<strong>权模</strong> (weight module).</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>有限维 $U\\mathfrak g$-模都是权模.</p>\n<p>伴随表示是权模.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>权模对张量积封闭.</p>\n<p>对于 $v\\in M_\\lambda$ 有 $Z\\mathfrak g v\\in M_\\lambda$.</p>\n"}]}}